# The image copies only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, alembic.ini, alembic/ and app/ (Dockerfile). The
# rest stays out of the build context: the virtualenv is large, a secret must never reach the daemon,
# and local bytecode shipped inside app/ until 2026-10-21 (76 .pyc files), which also made every
# local test run look like a source change to the build cache.
.env
.env.*
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
tests/
